Notes on this choice, recorded in docs/adr/0009-licence.md:

  * Every source file carries the header below.
  * The dependency tree is deliberately kept free of copyleft (AGPL, GPL, SSPL,
    MPL) licences, enforced by cargo-deny, so that a future decision to publish
    the source requires no dependency surgery. Reversing ADR-0009 is a licence
    decision, not an engineering project.

